---
import markSvg from '@/assets/brand/mark.svg?raw'
---

{/* The mark beside the name in both bars, which is the only place a visitor
    meets it while reading rather than in a tab or a profile.

    A sibling before the name rather than inside it. The landing bar's name is
    the slot the hero's flying name aims at, read as that element's own left
    edge, so a mark placed inside it moves the landing target and drops the name
    onto the mark. Outside it, the slot simply sits further right and the
    handoff needs no change.

    Hidden from assistive technology, since the name beside it says the same
    thing and a reader on a screen reader would otherwise hear it twice. That is
    also why it is not the control: it decorates the name rather than repeating
    the link. */}
<span
  data-bar-mark
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="text-foreground block size-6 shrink-0 [&>svg]:block [&>svg]:size-full"
  set:html={markSvg}
/>
